// S5: an empty range covers nothing, so it would silently disable
// the gate for the resource it claims to describe — the worst failure mode a
// capability check has. The degenerate entry is one of SEVERAL here, so a
// per-range check is required, not a check of the first.
sigil Bad { 0xDFF040 .. 0xDFF05A, 0xDFF080 .. 0xDFF080 }

fn main() { }
